Z||000011||Hoostine||07-18-2001||05:29 PM||||one time i was driving down an interstate next to a large steel beam on a truck.  i *ALMOST* went under it, but i wasn't sure if my car (85 300zx) would've fit.  if i had the t-tops off i probably would've gone under it.  the beam was about 80' long and there was no "trailer" under it.  it was attached to a small trailer in the front attached to the 5th wheel, and it was strapped to some wheels in the back.  it was pretty high up.  if i was in a fiero i wouldn't have hesitated going under it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>--Hoostine||||reg||1
